<h2 class="group">详细说明  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. AscendAttentionBackend 的定位  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">attention_v1.py</code> 中的 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">AscendAttentionBackend</code> 类注册为自定义注意力后端： <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:48-54</span></p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-weight: bold;">@register_backend(</span><span class="hljs-params" style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-weight: bold;">AttentionBackendEnum.CUSTOM, </span><span class="hljs-params" style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68); font-weight: bold;">"ASCEND"</span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-weight: bold;">)  </span><span>
</span><span></span><span class="hljs-class" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">class</span><span class="hljs-class"> </span><span class="hljs-class" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">AscendAttentionBackend</span><span class="hljs-class">(</span><span class="hljs-class hljs-params">AttentionBackend</span><span class="hljs-class">):</span></code></pre></pre>
<p>这相当于 vllm 主项目中各种注意力后端（如 FlashAttention、PagedAttention 等）的 Ascend NPU 版本。</p>
<h3 class="group">2. 实现的注意力方法  </h3>
<p>该文件实现了多种注意力计算方法：</p>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">forward_fused_infer_attention()</code> - 融合推理注意力 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:525-567</span></li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">forward_paged_attention()</code> - 分页注意力 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:569-587</span></li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">_forward_encoder_attention()</code> - 编码器注意力 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:589-620</span></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">3. 与 vllm 主项目的关系  </h3>
<p>在 vllm 主项目中，注意力后端位于 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">vllm/attention/backends/</code> 目录下，包含多种实现：</p>
<ul>
<li>FlashAttention</li>
<li>PagedAttention</li>
<li>Triton-based attention</li>
<li>其他自定义实现</li>
</ul>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">vllm_ascend/attention/attention_v1.py</code> 是 Ascend NPU 特定的实现，使用了 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu</code> 的算子如 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu.npu_fused_infer_attention_score</code> 和 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu._npu_paged_attention</code> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:548-562</span> 。</p>
<h3 class="group">4. 不是 triton_attn.py  </h3>
<p>虽然名称可能让人联想到 Triton，但这个文件：</p>
<ul>
<li>使用的是 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu</code> 算子而非 Triton kernels</li>
<li>专门针对 Ascend NPU 硬件优化</li>
<li>实现了 Ascend 特有的内存布局和计算优化</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
