<h2 class="group">关键差异处理  </h2>
<h3 class="group">算子替换  </h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>NPU算子 → GPU算子</strong>：
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu.npu_fused_infer_attention_score</code> → <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention</code></li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu._npu_paged_attention</code> → vLLM的PagedAttention</li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu._npu_reshape_and_cache</code> → GPU KV cache操作</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">内存管理  </h3>
<ul>
