0 hover:bg-purple-500/20 dark:text-purple-400 dark:hover:bg-purple-500/20" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M228.92,49.69a8,8,0,0,0-6.86-1.45L160.93,63.52,99.58,32.84a8,8,0,0,0-5.52-.6l-64,16A8,8,0,0,0,24,56V200a8,8,0,0,0,9.94,7.76l61.13-15.28,61.35,30.68A8.15,8.15,0,0,0,160,224a8,8,0,0,0,1.94-.24l64-16A8,8,0,0,0,232,200V56A8,8,0,0,0,228.92,49.69ZM104,52.94l48,24V203.06l-48-24ZM40,62.25l48-12v127.5l-48,12Zm176,131.5-48,12V78.25l48-12Z"></path></svg>View as codemap</button></div></div></div><div class="h-fit rounded-lg" style="scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(58, 58, 58) transparent;"><div class="dark:[&amp;_pre:has(code)]:bg-shade dark:[&amp;_code[data-lang]]:bg-shade relative flex max-w-none flex-col gap-1 rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-[#d0d0d0] bg-[#f8f8f8] p-4 text-white [overflow-wrap:anywhere] dark:border-[#2F2F2F] dark:bg-[#141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>多余的 4 个 token 是为了 CUDA Graph 对齐而添加的填充 token。</p>
<h2 class="group">详细说明  </h2>
<h3 class="group">填充机制  </h3>
<p>在 vllm-ascend 中，<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">num_input_tokens</code> 和 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">num_actual_tokens</code> 的差异来自于 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">pad_for_cudagraph</code> 函数的填充操作 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">eagle_proposer.py:440-444</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.use_cuda_graph </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">and</span><span> num_tokens &lt;= self.cudagraph_batch_sizes[-</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>]:  
</span>    num_input_tokens = self.vllm_config.pad_for_cudagraph(num_tokens)  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">else</span><span>:  
</span>    num_input_tokens = num_tokens</code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">填充目的  </h3>
<p>这种填充是为了满足 CUDA Graph 的预定义捕获大小要求 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">model_runner_v1.py:611-626</span> ：</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>性能优化</strong>：CUDA Graph 需要固定的输入大小才能高效重用计算图</li>
<li><strong>内存对齐</strong>：确保内存访问模式符合硬件优化要求</li>
<li><strong>批处理对齐</strong>：在批处理场景下保持一致的内存布局</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="group">具体实现  </h3>
<p>在 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">set_ascend_forward_context</code> 中，同时传递了填充后和实际的 token 数量 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">eagle_proposer.py:465-471</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">with</span><span> set_ascend_forward_context(  
</span>    {self.attn_layer_name: attn_metadata},  
    self.vllm_config,  
<span>    num_tokens=num_input_tokens,        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 填充后的数量 (224)  </span><span>
</span><span>    num_actual_tokens=num_tokens,       </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 实际数量 (220)  </span><span>
</span>    ...  
):</code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">MLA 中的填充逻辑  </h3>
<p>在 MLA (Multi-head Latent Attention) 实现中，还有更复杂的填充策略 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">mla_v1.py:311-353</span> ，特别是在 MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) 场景下，需要满足 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">npu_fused_infer_attention_score</code> 的约束条件。</p>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<p>这 4 个填充 token 不会影响实际的计算结果，因为：</p>
<ol>
<li>在注意力计算中会通过 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">num_actual_tokens</code> 参数忽略填充部分</li>
<li>填充 token 通常设置为特殊的 padding 值，不会影响有效计算</li>
<li>最终输出时会根据实际 token 数量进行裁剪</li>
</ol>
<p>这种设计是 CUDA Graph 优化的常见做法，通过少量内存开销换取显著的性能提升。</p>
